Method 2: Administrator creates it

          A SharePoint/Microsoft 365 administrator can also create and manage sites through the SharePoint Admin Center.
          For example:
          SharePoint Admin Center → Active sites → Create
          Admin creation is useful when the organization wants tighter governance over:
              Who can create sites
              Site ownership
              Storage
              Sharing
              Site settings
              Policies
          We'll cover the SharePoint Admin Center much later in our list.
